_:nb77a0da38fd141f4a38cd29200986e57b9 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:nb77a0da38fd141f4a38cd29200986e57b9 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:nb77a0da38fd141f4a38cd29200986e57b9 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#propulsionOutputRestrictionApplies> .
